{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨晚（11月2日）11時許，警方接獲途人報案，發現一名女子倒臥在元朗青山公路洪水橋段近鍾屋村輕鐵站對開路中花槽，昏迷不醒。</p><p>救護員接報到場，女子頭部重傷，隨即將她送往屯門醫院，惜經搶救後證實不治。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:43:06.566528+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:09:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T19:18:16.774815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:38:48.687296+00:00","content_hash":"67848328e5ccbe4afb350df054d0dd4fc03c0c35deb17ebf0d9f4134d0e5ec38","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}